OL,3,GNEWSABoulders dropped off coast to
OL,4,Adisrupt deep fishing
OL,5,
OL,6,FGreenpeace has dropped nine boulders
OL,7,Foff the east coast of England to create
OL,8,Fa barrier that disrupts bottom trawling
OL,9,Fby fishing vessels.
OL,11,FThe environmental campaigners' ship
OL,12,FArctic Sunrise released the rocks,
OL,13,Fwithout a licence, over the weekend
OL,14,Fabout 50km (30 miles) east of Great
OL,15,FYarmouth, Norfolk.
OL,17,FBottom trawling involves dragging
OL,18,Fweighted nets along the seabed to catch
OL,19,Ffish, although it can harm underwater
OL,20,Fvegetation.
OL,23,APub: 03-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
